map.：某住宅小区 500 户，位于大城市，指标 0.8 车位/户：\n总车位 = 5:
A residential community of 500 households in a large city with an indicator of 0.8 spaces per household:
total spaces = 500 x 0.8 = 400 (divisor = 1, since housing is counted per household);
visitor spaces 10% -> 40, regular spaces 360;
accessible spaces = max(1, ceil(400 x 2%)) = 8 (included in the regular spaces);
parking area = about 400 x 25 = 10000 m2 (about 1.0 ha).

map.：某办公楼建筑面积 50000 m²，大城市指标 0.8 车位/100m²：\n:
An office building of 50000 m2 with a large-city indicator of 0.8 spaces per 100 m2:
total spaces = 50000 / 100 x 0.8 = 400;
visitor 5% -> 20, regular 380, accessible 8;
parking area = about 400 x 35 = 14000 m2.
